[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e94\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_cher_5",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$escape_intro",
        "key": "$escape_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You have no reason to object, right? Just a few insects that flew too close to the light... are they really worth your time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "My troops have already received your info. You've already done your part.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "All that's left for you to do is to go home. After all, you're just responsible for the core energy sector and its surroundings...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't do anything unnecessary...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You still have somewhere else to be, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine. Have it your way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't wait to see you fail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're leaving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "One of the enemy leaders... just took a portion of the Reunion troops and left?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are they up to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever it is, we can't let our guard down... The enemy is still many times our size!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, well. Please allow me to apologize on Crownslayer's behalf for her rudeness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can call me Mephisto.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is Reunion trying to accomplish?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, nothing in particular. To be honest, I wouldn't even mind letting you bunch go. You weren't even our targets in the first place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we weren't your targets, then why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I had the honor of watching your battles.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your combat tactics as well as your personnel configuration were quite intriguing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Intriguing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think that the carnage of battle is... intriguing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island... I've read up on your group before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "At first, I thought you were just another ordinary company.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "But by the looks of things, don't you think your ambitions have stretched a bit too far from playing with test tubes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'd be terribly dull if I allowed you to just walk out of here, wouldn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I'd like is to have a little competition, a ritual of sorts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We don't have time to waste on a preoperational kid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Amiya, get ready. We might have to break through with force.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'll get his attention...!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Mm, okay!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_signalbomb"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What was that just now? Who were you sending a signal to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "None of your business, kid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Amiya?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, we're all professionals here. Where's your basic courtesy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "If people like you didn't exist, I wouldn't have to constantly be honing my insults!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Amiya, what's going on?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Dobermann... All of our escape routes have been blocked by his troops!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "(How can that be?! How did he manage to do that in just a few minutes--)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This simply won't do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though I gave you my sincere invitation...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "But all you can think of...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "...is running away?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I'll let you leave my hunting grounds safely as long as you win.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until then, my friends here will keep trying to kill you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's your victory as long as you don't die! The rules are simple enough, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ace!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're already prepared to break through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we have to stave off their attacks first!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you doing this? The Catastrophe is coming! If we don't leave Chernobog, then everyone will--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Catastrophe... makes it the best time to celebrate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're sick...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "My esteemed guests, I am honored to invite you to this game.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Argh... Argh...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kill... Kill! ! Kill... them all!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya! Watch out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, we know exactly what you did in the central area.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That masked person you rescued... makes me very, very curious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crownslayer is so fixated on what you're going to do next, where you're going to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm different. What I care about is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly are you? Where are you from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, you. The one staring at me right now... You are somewhat different from us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was the device in that facility that was able to preserve your life?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am so, very curious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "See, I'm not such a cold-blooded person...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "So how about it, my esteemed Rhodes Island guests, how about giving this person to me as a gift?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "It would be a shame to end the game early, but at least I'll let the rest of you go. How about it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get behind me!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    }
]